{"id":"05999fb8e91a2bce","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-filter-p-point-ultrafilter.md","title":"ZFC Filter P Point Ultrafilter","display":"df-zfc-filter-p-point-ultrafilter — ZFC Filter P Point Ultrafilter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter-p-point-ultrafilter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter-p-point-ultrafilter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter-p-point-ultrafilter — ZFC Filter P Point Ultrafilter","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter-p-point-ultrafilter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter-p-point-ultrafilter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter-p-point-ultrafilter — ZFC Filter P Point Ultrafilter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,\\langle A_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle,B\\in V\">\\(U,\\langle A_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle,B\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterPPointUltrafilter}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilterPPointUltrafilter}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}p\\text{-}point\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilterPPointUltrafilter}_S(U) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land \\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\{n\\}\\notin U)\\land \\forall\\langle A_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\\in U^\\omega\\;\\exists B\\in U\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(|B\\setminus A_n|&lt;\\omega)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}p\\text{-}point\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilterPPointUltrafilter}_S(U) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land \\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\{n\\}\\notin U)\\land \\forall\\langle A_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\\in U^\\omega\\;\\exists B\\in U\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(|B\\setminus A_n|&lt;\\omega)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The singleton exclusion fixes the usual free-ultrafilter convention for P-points on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> is a pseudointersection of the countable family modulo finite sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U,\\langle A_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterPPointUltrafilter}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}p\\text{-}point\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilterPPointUltrafilter}_S(U) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land \\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\{n\\}\\notin U)\\land \\forall\\langle A_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\\in U^\\omega\\;\\exists B\\in U\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(|B\\setminus A_n|<\\omega)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":1300,"backlinks":[{"id":"f0f12d37e6b6ad32","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilterPPointUltrafilter}_S$ (P-point ultrafilter predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-filter-p-point-ultrafilter]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1879","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-filter-p-point-ultrafilter.md|58-df-zfc-filter-p-point-ultrafilter]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}